<title>USA: COMSAT Corp Q1 net per share loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>COMSAT Corp Q1 net per share loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Md. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.11   profit	 $0.19</p>
<p> Net loss		   5,300   profit	 9,300</p>
<p> Revs		     281,700		  248,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  48,900		   48,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Q1 1997 results include losses in sports and entertainment operations of Ascent Entertainment Group Inc. Excluding Ascent and other operations COMSAT plans to divest in 1997, Q1 net income would have been a profit of $6.8 million, or $0.14 per share, on revenues of $132.9 million.</p>
</text>
